flowchart LR
    User[Internet User]
    Admin[Administrator]

    subgraph Azure[Microsoft Azure]
        subgraph VNet[RouteWell VNet 10.10.0.0/16]
            subgraph GatewaySubnet[Application Gateway Subnet]
                AGW[Azure Application Gateway]
            end

            subgraph WebSubnet[Web Subnet]
                WebVM[Ubuntu Web VM<br/>Nginx + React]
            end

            subgraph AppSubnet[Application Subnet]
                AppVM[Ubuntu App VM<br/>Node.js + Express + PM2]
            end

            subgraph DbSubnet[Database Subnet]
                DbVM[Ubuntu Database VM<br/>PostgreSQL<br/>No Public IP]
            end
        end
    end

    User -->|HTTPS 443| AGW
    AGW -->|Web traffic| WebVM
    WebVM -->|Private API traffic| AppVM
    AppVM -->|TCP 5432| DbVM
    Admin -. Controlled SSH .-> WebVM
    Admin -. Controlled SSH .-> AppVM
